{% comment %}
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Legendary Branding — Bebas Neue font loader + product description styles
  v1.0.0 · May 2026

  Purpose:
    1. Self-host Bebas Neue (woff2) so product Body HTML headers render
       in the actual Bebas Neue typeface instead of falling back to
       Oswald / Arial Narrow / sans-serif.
    2. Boost visual weight: Bebas Neue is only published in weight 400,
       so we use -webkit-text-stroke + text-shadow to give it the
       "thicker, bolder, balanced presence" the brand wants without
       loading a non-existent weight.
    3. Force perfect horizontal centering of the product Body HTML on
       desktop, regardless of how narrow the right-hand product column is.

  Render location: layout/theme.liquid <head>, after {% render 'fonts' %}
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%}
  v1.1.0 (2026-05-19): REMOVED Google Fonts dependency.

  Previously preconnected + preloaded woff2 from fonts.gstatic.com,
  but Shopify's font_picker (settings.type_heading_font = bebas_neue_n4)
  already self-hosts the same font at:
    legendary-branding.com/cdn/fonts/bebas_neue/bebasneue_n4.{hash}.woff2
  emitted server-side by {% render 'fonts' %} in theme.liquid (line 68).

  Loading both sources caused:
    1. Duplicate ~13KB woff2 download
    2. Extra DNS+TLS handshake to fonts.gstatic.com (~80-150ms cold)
    3. FOIT/FOUT thrashing as the two sources raced
    4. PSI 'Use efficient cache lifetimes' warning (Google Fonts caches
       short, Shopify CDN caches long)

  The Shopify-hosted Bebas Neue is loaded by 'fonts' snippet, so all
  we need here is the .lb-body-rte typography styles. The 'Bebas Neue'
  font-family is already available globally.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   .lb-body-rte — wrapper applied to product Body HTML content.
   Targets headers + paragraphs we generated for the 80 active products.
   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.lb-body-rte {
  /* Force full-width within whatever column we sit in, then center inside */
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 100%;
  margin-inline: auto;
  text-align: center;
}

.lb-body-rte > * {
  margin-inline: auto;
}

/* Bebas Neue-styled headers — bolder, balanced presence */
.lb-body-rte h2 {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', 'Oswald', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;              /* Bebas Neue is published only in 400 */
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center !important;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;

  /* Visual weight boost — synthetic thickening of a single-weight typeface */
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0.55px currentColor;
  text-shadow: 0 0 0.25px currentColor;
  font-synthesis: weight style;  /* allow UA bolding fallback if any */
}

/* Hero (largest) title — slightly tighter spacing, larger size */
.lb-body-rte h2.lb-hero {
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.2vw, 2.1rem);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0.75px currentColor;
}

/* Section headers */
.lb-body-rte h2.lb-section {
  font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.4vw, 1.35rem);
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.lb-body-rte p {
  text-align: center !important;
  margin-inline: auto;
  max-width: 680px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

/* Size guide table container — center the whole table block */
.lb-body-rte .lb-table-wrap {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 1rem auto 1.5rem auto;
  overflow-x: auto;          /* desktop wide tables stay scrollable on narrow viewports */
}

.lb-body-rte table {
  margin: 0 auto;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.lb-body-rte table th {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', 'Oswald', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0.45px currentColor;
  background: #111;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #333;
}

.lb-body-rte table td {
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
}

/* Desktop: even more presence on Bebas + roomier centering */
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .lb-body-rte {
    padding-inline: 16px;
  }
  .lb-body-rte h2 {
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.7px currentColor;
  }
  .lb-body-rte h2.lb-hero {
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.9px currentColor;
  }
}

/* Mobile: keep table readable */
@media (max-width: 749px) {
  .lb-body-rte table { font-size: 11px; }
  .lb-body-rte table th,
  .lb-body-rte table td { padding: 6px 8px; }
}
</style>
